# Zoho WorkDrive — team deliverables

Whenever creating or updating **team-facing** Siya Health materials (editorial packs, carousels, statics, reels, LinkedIn banners, brand/editorial rules, captions, trackers), also update:

```text
~/Library/CloudStorage/ZohoWorkDriveTrueSync-AmcareMedicalConsultancyIndiaPvtLtd/Common Folder/Siya Knowledge Editorial/
```

## Folder map

| Asset type | Put in |
|------------|--------|
| Brand / editorial rules | `00-Brand-System/` |
| Tracker row + spreadsheet | `04-Content-Tracker/Siya-Content-Tracker.xlsx` |
| Carousels (multi-slide) | `05-Carousels/[Insight-ID]/` |
| Statics / banners / singles | `06-Statics/...` |
| How-to | `03-START-HERE/` |

## Required habit

1. Write files to the Common Folder path above (TrueSync syncs for the team).
2. Add or update a row in `Siya-Content-Tracker.xlsx` (or the CSV) for every new post/asset.
3. Do **not** leave team-ready assets only on Desktop or only in git — Common Folder is the team source of truth for deliverables.
4. Git remains source of truth for **code**; WorkDrive for **editorial deliverables**.

Do not sync secrets, `.env`, or the full `amcare-os` monorepo into WorkDrive.

## Captions (required with every visual pack)

Ship platform-specific caption docs **alongside images**:
`05-Carousels/[ID]/captions/` and `ready-to-post/captions/`
Include: Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn Company, LinkedIn Founder (no CTA), X/Twitter, Pinterest.
Also include `ALL-PLATFORMS.md` (or equivalent) for one-file copy-paste.
